      "words": 25
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I don’t hate you,” she said quietly. “I find you maddening.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3760
        }
      ],
      "words": 11
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Because I’m afraid of how good it feels.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4344
        }
      ],
      "words": 8
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He had wormed his way into her life so completely, and she didn’t want him to leave",
